   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 4
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Every interaction, end to end.** Chat UI, OpenAI shim, Ollama shim and voice (`pipeline.*` spans from the orchestrator) plus HA voice runs (`voice.run`, from voice_tracer) and the music blueprint's fast path (`blueprint.run`).\n\nVoice is measured from the moment HA received the satellite's stream (wake-word detection runs on the satellite and is not visible to HA) to the TTS request. Traces become searchable about one to two minutes after the request (Tempo cuts a block every 30 s; voice runs wait for their Kronk join). Latency budget (CLAUDE.md tenet 12): ~2 s local tier, 15\u201325 s Kronk tier."
   }
  },
